## 2.2 Manage Reports Entry Point

The Report List page header bar includes a 'Manage Reports' button for Report Developer and Administrator users. This button is not rendered for any other user type.

- 'Manage Reports' button — MUI Button, variant='outlined', placed in the page header bar on the right side alongside any other page-level actions.

- Clicking 'Manage Reports' navigates to the Report Definition Management screen (Section 7.6.2).

- The 'Manage Reports' button is visible to: is_report_developer = TRUE or is_administrator = TRUE. It is not rendered for any other user.

| **Claude Code Note**** Manage Reports button — placement:   Add to the page header bar of the Report List page (right side, standard page header pattern).   Visibility: {(is_report_developer ││ is_administrator) ****&****&**** ****<****Button variant=****'****outlined****'**** onClick={()=****>****navigate(****'****/reporting/manage****'****)}****>****Manage Reports****<****/Button****>****}** |
